red_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"VfgEzpaIHpq4sR2s2P6o5w","review_id":"QPGE9yI0IUSQPxXpGuUToQ","date":"2012-09-17T19:08:27","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9350540041923523,"text_excerpt":"Being from Dallas originally, I have been waiting for a place like Snappy Salads to open here ever since I moved here. The prices are about the same as are the salad options. There are days I just want a light and healthy salad, and there are days I want to feel healthy but am starving and pack stuff on the salad. This place will suit both needs, and I thought the staff was pleasant. I dig it! It is also close to Audoban park for a post-workout meal. Check it!"},{"business_id":"VfgEzpaIHpq4sR2s2P6o5w","review_id":"D-jkSFjherDGeEyJfA5CUg","date":"2012-11-05T16:32:44","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9343951344490051,"text_excerpt":"I was running errands on Magazine a couple of weekends ago and discovered that a store I was aiming for had shut down (disappointing!) but then I noticed a few doors down this new salad spot (intriguing!) So it was time for lunch. The set up was a bit confusing to me since I hadn't been to one of these yet (because it feels like a franchise, right?) Anyway, my salad was tasty and full of premium ingredients. No skimping here. The ingredients were all really fresh (hey! it's in the name!) and tasty. And I liked that you could completely customize your salad to your own particular taste buds. Things I didn't like: I was dining in so I would have liked less disposable (and wasteful) options,..."},{"business_id":"VfgEzpaIHpq4sR2s2P6o5w","review_id":"B98taIgOlaNg6Fa5Fk8XoA","date":"2012-07-24T13:10:47","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9287458658218384,"text_excerpt":"New Orleans has been dying for a place like this. There is literally no other place to get a good salad uptown other than Whole Foods. And let's face it, you don't really get a salad at Whole Foods once you get over there and the mac and cheese is burbling. I know you, New Orleans! The salads are fresh and the dressings are very creative. In the past few weeks I've had the pepper jelly vinaigrette, citrus vinaigrette, and an oil free cilantro dressing. They also have some ranchy-type stuff if your wife makes you eat there against your will ;) I'm very happy to support this local salad emporium and eat there a few times a week. This is the type of place that you eat so that you can eat you..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"VfgEzpaIHpq4sR2s2P6o5w","photo_id":"qRxidbsqHeh18tfEXMFcvQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/qRxidbsqHeh18tfEXMFcvQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9038805365562439},{"business_id":"VfgEzpaIHpq4sR2s2P6o5w","photo_id":"EH_Xzo0CBhhhqMWlVJyy1Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/EH_Xzo0CBhhhqMWlVJyy1Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.845831573009491},{"business_id":"VfgEzpaIHpq4sR2s2P6o5w","photo_id":"5xYX7HFiDZoUbBaMGjywxg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/5xYX7HFiDZoUbBaMGjywxg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8186086416244507}]},"notebook_case":null}
